          "reason": "Bounded source verification: inspected original OSF registration responses and schemas. X3DVA was registered 2022-03-14, is not withdrawn, describes three 14-day CGM periods versus finger pricks, targets 300 participants, allocates by entry week, and plans 12-month HbA1c. EH6YB was registered 2026-08-21 and explicitly discloses prior observation of source data before the proposed analyses. These are registration intentions and disclosures; completed outcomes are not inferred. The final preserved independent audit also assesses this candidate as supported."
        },
